+/* Returns whether the mouse is over the menu bar, on the same terms
+   debugMenu()'s own return value does for the Debug window -- both feed
+   into the caller's single mouse_over_debug gate that suppresses viewport
+   rotate/pan/pick while over any UI chrome, so a click opening "File"
